<p>I don't know. Its an interesting skip.</p>
<p>I'm not exactly sure what went on. First the anomaly gets stolen by the Insurgency, that then tinkers with it to try to weaponize it. They somewhat succeed into creating an AI that is uncontainable by the Foundation, and kills everyone it interacts with because its pissy.</p>
<p>Then it sends an email to the current researcher, Dr. Adebiyi Ogundimu, telling it it wants blood.</p>
